From 1a8ac1e17877fa6ec9e0942e94783cc3d4390e36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObliviOS Build <build@oblivios.local>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 20:57:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compartments: list the apps that may use the loopback
 interface in a global setting

A runtime grant of USE_LOOPBACK_INTERFACE needs the app to declare it, so the profile Trusted did
nothing for an app that does not (CMP-005). The service writes the app ids of the Trusted apps
that are installed in the owner user into the global setting oblivios_loopback_app_ids at every
mirror (MirrorPlan.loopbackAppIds, LoopbackAppIds), for the connectivity module to read.
---
