 .../server/compartments/LoopbackAppIds.java   | 77 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../server/compartments/MirrorPlan.java       | 16 ++++
 3 files changed, 105 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 services/core/java/com/android/server/compartments/LoopbackAppIds.java

